## 🚀 NEW: Phase 1 Few-Shot Breakthrough (Llama-3.3-70B)

We ran a rapid experiment on the K-EmoCon validation dataset incorporating fixed, randomly sampled examples directly into the system prompt. The LLM was given 3 pairs of sensor readings -> JSON valence/arousal annotations.

| Model / Approach | Valence MAE | Arousal MAE | Val. Acc ±1 | Aro. Acc ±1 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Llama-70B **(Zero-Shot Baseline)** | 0.763 | 1.113 | 75.0% | 39.3% |
| Llama-70B **(3-Shot In-Context)** | **0.177** | **0.548** | **100.0%** | **85.7%** |

*The model achieved 100% accuracy within a 1-point margin for Valence, proving it can seamlessly identify physiological baselines when prompted correctly.*

